   732 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   733 				; Image_Open - OPEN FileNamePtr for read on the first free IOCB (the same
   734 				; sequence LoadData uses, but the file stays open across several block reads).
   735 				;  Out: C=0 and Load_IOCB = IOCB offset, or C=1 (no IOCB / OPEN failed - the
   736 				;       IOCB is closed again so it doesn't leak).
