   763 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   764 				; Image_Read_Segment - read one fixed-size block of the open .V1K into VRAM
   765 				; through the 4K MEMAC window, 4K at a time, then the partial tail.
   766 				;  In:  A = first VBXE bank, X = full 4K chunks, Seg_Tail = tail bytes (0 ok)
   767 				;  Out: C=1 on any CIO error (including EOF before the block is complete)
   768 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
