   831 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   832 				; Apply_Menu_Palettes - put the menu/info screen's palettes back in the
   833 				; hardware registers: set 0 = the de-interleaved text palette UI_Build_
   834 				; TextPalette left resident at VBXE $00800, sets 1-3 = the banner's R/G/B
   835 				; ramps, generated on the fly.  No disk access, no stored ramp data.
   836 				; Clears Pal_Image.  Called once from start:, and from Enter_Selector (ui.asm)
   837 				; only when Pal_Image says an image palette replaced them - VBXE has exactly 4
   838 				; palette registers total (FX manual, "RGB PALETTE MODIFICATION") and there is
   839 				; no per-XDL copy, so after a real image this refresh can't be avoided; after
   840 				; Info / Drive / Quit / a directory P-preview it isn't needed and is skipped.
   841 				; The logo VRAM itself is never rewritten.
