   974 				; Attribute-cell byte offsets (within a 160-byte expanded map row) for the 8
   975 				; columns the demo overlay covers - cell*4+3 (the real attribute byte; the
   976 				; other 3 bytes/cell are always zero - the whole map is zeroed at boot by
   977 				; clear_vbxe).  Left-edge block = cells 0-3 (pixels 0-31); right-edge block = cells
   978 				; 36-39 (pixels 288-319, since MENU_BANNER_PITCH/8 = 40 cells/row).
   979 36D9			Menu_Demo_Attr_Cols
