  1444 				; Increment_Image - advance File_Index within the *.V1K file band
  1445 				; [FileStart, ImageCount), wrapping past the last file to the first.
  1446 				; No-op when the list holds no files.  (The selector list may now also carry
  1447 				; ".." and directory rows below FileStart - Space/BkSp must skip those.)
  1448 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
