   224 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   225 				; Text_Present - copy the whole back buffer (TEXT_BACK_VRAM) onto the displayed
   226 				; text screen (TEXT_SCREEN_VRAM) with one BLT_TEXT_RECT blit, kicked in vblank
   227 				; (Wait_VBlank) so the change lands between frames.  Clears Txt_Dirty.
   228 				; Clobbers A/Y.
